    "_method": "Each candidate's maze gives a chance P = logistic(logit(base) + intentScale*intent + strengthScale*strength). A seeded Monte Carlo (mulberry32, FNV-1a seed of the name) runs 11,111 times; each run declares when its draw lands under P. Contender is a label once P is above 64.9%.",
