  "legislation": {
    "_about": "Key Legislation: every member's chance of voting yes on each big bill, then 11,111 simulated roll calls for the chance it passes. Same idea as The 29th Vote. Data lives in public/data/legislation/: members.csv, bills.csv, positions.csv (one row per vote, statement or signal) and log.csv (append-only daily history).",
